// "Deathless Black Snake" (enemy_1515_bsnake, levels 0 and 1): chapter 8 (H8-4, JT8-3). Four native modes:
// Default (first form), Reborn (second form), ScreenAttack and FinalScreenAttack (the two Deathless Infernos).
// - Attack (both forms): one ground operator in range (record range 2; trigger collider 2.25 placeholder), True damage
//   (_damageType 3, _atkScale 1) at the clip's OnAttack, and Burning Breath (talent fire.attack@dragon_fire.*) on it;
//   a re-application refreshes the duration (PRTS).
// - Ignite (19/19 s): up to two operators anywhere (ground and air) that carry no Burning Breath (_buffKeyExcluded),
//   Burning Breath from the skill blackboard. Skill_1 1.967 s, release 1.167 s. Needs at least one target.
// - DragonFireExplode (35/35 s): every unit carrying Burning Breath (the selector's buff filter; PRTS: all of them,
//   cast even with none), in order: 100% ATK Arts to it; its Burning Breath ends; 100% ATK Arts to the operators on its
//   tile and the four around it (range x-5) except itself, re-igniting them. Any failed step ends that unit's chain
//   (PRTS). Skill_2 1.967 s, release 1.033 s.
// - Protect (talent): damage from a unit carrying this Black Snake's Burning Breath (BUFF_SOURCE) x (1 - 0.5).
// - Knock-outs (Reborn, _maxRespawnCnt 2). Each releases the current wave (first: track_at_next_wave on leaving
//   Default; second: finish_current_wave on leaving Reborn). First: a 5 s revive at full HP (as the reviewed bosses;
//   the pinned _hpRechargeRatio 0.5 does not set it), then reborn_up (max HP and ATK +reborn.max_hp/atk, 50%) and
//   the Deathless Inferno. Second: he stays down 5 s, then the final Inferno, then InstantKill.
// - Deathless Inferno (ScreenAttack: duration 28, interval 2, trig_cnt 10, invincible 15, atk_scale 1): invincible
//   (flags 5 INVINCIBLE, 22 UNMOVABLE_PRIVATE), no move/block/attack/skill. Every 2 s (first at 2 s; 10 volleys) a
//   column of projectile_enemy_bsnake fireballs enters from the left border, one per row, flying right (speed 2.5,
//   collider 0.25, lifetime 60, first operator hit, through walls, up to 0.1 s random start); 100% ATK Arts. After 28 s
//   the first Inferno returns him to the second form with 15 s of invincibility; the final one kills him.
// - SummonFlame (second form only, 50/75 s, ignores silence): MoveNextLevelBranch (loop) on the stage's bsnake_flame
//   branch: the next five Energy Aggregates appear (stage-flames.js). Skill_3 2.333 s, release 0.9 s. The Hint /
//   HintCountdown marks and hint.location / hint.interval are presentation (they mirror the branch phases).
// Skill cooldowns run from the cast start and restart from their initial values when the second form begins.
